<concept importance="optional" base="Top" id="t00223">
	<title id="e01388">Seatback pocket </title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>seat
					<indexterm>seatback pocket</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<p>There is a pocket (2) in the front seatback for storing simple books or atlases, as well as a USB charger (1) for rear passengers.</p>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e01389">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e01390">
								<image href="images/N_SP3i26_D06_040_E.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<note type="warning">
			<p>Seatback pockets</p>
			<p>Do not put heavy, stiff, or sharp objects in the seatback pockets. In an accident, they could contact and injure vehicle occupants.</p>
		</note>
	</conbody>
